      "**CR7** is the nickname and personal brand of **Cristiano Ronaldo**, the Portuguese professional football (soccer) star.  \n",
      "\n",
      "- **Full name:** Cristiano Ronaldo dos Santos Aveiro  \n",
      "- **Born:** 5 February 1985, Funchal, Madeira, Portugal  \n",
      "- **Position:** Forward (primarily a goal‑scoring winger/striker)  \n",
      "- **Clubs:** Sporting CP → Manchester United (2003‑2009, 2021‑2023) → Real Madrid (2009‑2018) → Juventus (2018‑2021) → Al Nassr (2023‑present)  \n",
      "- **Major achievements:**  \n",
      "  - 5× Ballon d’Or winner (best player in the world)  \n",
      "  - Over 800 career goals for club and country (one of the all‑time top scorers)  \n",
      "  - 5× UEFA Champions League titles (1 with Manchester United, 4 with Real Madrid)  \n",
      "  - European Championship winner with Portugal (Euro 2016) and Nations League champion (2019)  \n",
      "- **CR7 brand:** The “CR7” moniker combines his initials (C R) and his jersey number (7). He uses it for his line of clothing, fragrances, hotels, gyms, and other business ventures.  \n",
      "\n",
      "In short, CR7 is the globally recognized brand of Cristiano Ronaldo, one of the most celebrated and marketable athletes in sports history.\n"
     ]
